        "fields": {
          "notes": "The source-visible title page describes a Russian translation from German and leaves the translator unnamed. A contemporary 1901 report associates the Reader book with material reprinted from the New Journal and thus with Antonovsky’s historical route. Responsibility and derivation remain unresolved pending source-page attribution or collation; the Expression retains a provisional identity."
